# Two images are built from the repository root: the control plane's
# (Dockerfile) and the sandbox's (sandbox-image/Dockerfile). Only what they
# copy is sent to the Docker daemon, which keeps the build context small and
# keeps local build output and dependencies out of it.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/protocol
!packages/sandbox-providers
!apps/control-plane
!apps/web
!apps/sandbox-supervisor
!sandbox-image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
